<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#dongmaeng">Glossary</a> · Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dongmaeng</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Dongmaeng was a great state festival of Goguryeo held in the tenth month of the year to give thanks to Heaven, recorded in the Chinese <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/records-of-the-three-kingdoms">Records of the Three Kingdoms</a>. The whole country assembled for sacrifices, singing and dancing. It was one of several harvest festivals of the early Korean states.</p></div>
